---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import FaqBG from '../images/FaqBG.png';
---

<Layout>
  <!-- ====== Hero ====== -->
  <section class="relative flex min-h-[55vh] items-center overflow-hidden lg:min-h-[65vh]">
    <div class="absolute inset-0">
      <img
        src={FaqBG.src}
        alt="OLLI community gathering"
        class="h-full w-full object-cover blur-sm scale-110"
      />
      <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-[#02275A]/90 via-[#02275A]/70 to-[#02275A]/45"></div>
      <div class="pointer-events-none absolute -top-32 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 h-[500px] w-[800px] max-w-full opacity-[0.2]" style="background: radial-gradient(ellipse 50% 50% at center, #004ADD 0%, transparent 70%);"></div>
    </div>

    <div class="relative z-10 mx-auto w-full max-w-4xl px-4 pb-16 pt-24 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="max-w-3xl">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full border border-blue-300/40 bg-white/15 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-blue-200 shadow-sm backdrop-blur-sm">
          Support & Info
        </div>
        <h1 class="mt-6 text-4xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-extrabold font-display text-white leading-tight tracking-[-0.02em]" style="text-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.4), 0 0 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.1);">
          Frequently Asked Questions
        </h1>
        <p class="mt-6 text-lg text-white/80 leading-relaxed max-w-2xl">
          Find clear, practical answers to the questions members ask most often about membership, classes, accessibility, and day-to-day participation.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Curved bottom separator -->
    <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 z-10 h-16">
      <svg class="h-full w-full" viewBox="0 0 1440 64" preserveAspectRatio="none">
        <defs>
          <linearGradient id="faq-hero-to-first" x1="0" y1="0" x2="0" y2="1">
            <stop offset="0%" stop-color="#02275A" />
            <stop offset="100%" stop-color="#4FB3B0" />
          </linearGradient>
        </defs>
        <path d="M0 64 Q360 0 720 32 Q1080 64 1440 16 L1440 64 Z" fill="url(#faq-hero-to-first)" />
      </svg>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="bg-gradient-to-b from-[#4FB3B0] via-[#6FB9C2] to-[#02275A] py-20">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[1.45fr_0.85fr] items-start">
        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-white/60 bg-gradient-to-br from-[#E4F6F2]/60 via-white/50 to-[#EEF4FD]/60 p-5 shadow-[0_20px_60px_-25px_rgba(2,39,90,0.25)] backdrop-blur-md sm:p-8">
          <div class="mb-8 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
            <span class="rounded-full border border-[#A9DEDA] bg-white px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[#1E8F8A]">
              Member Support
            </span>
          </div>

          <div class="divide-y divide-[#D5ECE8]">
            <details class="group">
              <summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 py-6 text-lg font-semibold font-display text-[#155E5C] transition hover:bg-white/40 rounded-2xl px-2 [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden">
                <span>What are the main office hours?</span>
                <span class="flex h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[#E0F6F2]/70 text-xl font-medium text-[#1E8F8A] shadow-sm transition group-open:rotate-45">+</span>
              </summary>
              <div class="px-2 pb-6 text-base leading-7 text-slate-700">
                Monday – Friday: 8:00 AM–5:00 PM
              </div>
            </details>

            <details class="group">
              <summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 py-6 text-lg font-semibold font-display text-[#155E5C] transition hover:bg-white/40 rounded-2xl px-2 [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden">
                <span>How do I become a member?</span>
                <span class="flex h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[#E0F6F2]/70 text-xl font-medium text-[#1E8F8A] shadow-sm transition group-open:rotate-45">+</span>
              </summary>
              <div class="px-2 pb-6 text-base leading-7 text-slate-700">
                You may sign up in person at the main office or via the website. To join online, click the link “Join OLLI-HU”, fill out the form, and pay your dues.
              </div>
            </details>

            <details class="group">
              <summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 py-6 text-lg font-semibold font-display text-[#155E5C] transition hover:bg-white/40 rounded-2xl px-2 [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden">
                <span>How can members volunteer?</span>
                <span class="flex h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[#E0F6F2]/70 text-xl font-medium text-[#1E8F8A] shadow-sm transition group-open:rotate-45">+</span>
              </summary>
              <div class="px-2 pb-6 text-base leading-7 text-slate-700">
                Activities are organized and operated by our members. As a democratic membership organization, OLLI at HU depends on the volunteer services of its members. Volunteering brings involvement in the Institute in meaningful and satisfying ways.
              </div>
            </details>

            <details class="group">
              <summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 py-6 text-lg font-semibold font-display text-[#155E5C] transition hover:bg-white/40 rounded-2xl px-2 [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden">
                <span>Can members bring a guest to classes or activities?</span>
                <span class="flex h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[#E0F6F2]/70 text-xl font-medium text-[#1E8F8A] shadow-sm transition group-open:rotate-45">+</span>
              </summary>
              <div class="px-2 pb-6 text-base leading-7 text-slate-700">
                OLLI classes and activities are designed for members only. However, members may bring a guest for a one-time visit as a class auditor; the guest may attend as long as they pay the appropriate fee and are approved by OLLI at HU staff.
              </div>
            </details>

            <details class="group">
              <summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 py-6 text-lg font-semibold font-display text-[#155E5C] transition hover:bg-white/40 rounded-2xl px-2 [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden">
                <span>Where are classes located?</span>
                <span class="flex h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[#E0F6F2]/70 text-xl font-medium text-[#1E8F8A] shadow-sm transition group-open:rotate-45">+</span>
              </summary>
              <div class="px-2 pb-6 text-base leading-7 text-slate-700">
                Classes are held at the W.O. Lawton Building and various local satellite locations, depending on the schedule for each term.
              </div>
            </details>

            <details class="group">
              <summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 py-6 text-lg font-semibold font-display text-[#155E5C] transition hover:bg-white/40 rounded-2xl px-2 [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden">
                <span>Do members need parking passes?</span>
                <span class="flex h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[#E0F6F2]/70 text-xl font-medium text-[#1E8F8A] shadow-sm transition group-open:rotate-45">+</span>
              </summary>
              <div class="px-2 pb-6 text-base leading-7 text-slate-700">
                When attending day and/or overnight trips, a parking pass is required and should be obtained in advance through the appropriate office or event instructions.
              </div>
            </details>

            <details class="group">
              <summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 py-6 text-lg font-semibold font-display text-[#155E5C] transition hover:bg-white/40 rounded-2xl px-2 [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden">
                <span>Can accommodations be provided for accessibility needs?</span>
                <span class="flex h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[#E0F6F2]/70 text-xl font-medium text-[#1E8F8A] shadow-sm transition group-open:rotate-45">+</span>
              </summary>
              <div class="px-2 pb-6 text-base leading-7 text-slate-700">
                We are dedicated to making our courses and events accessible to all participants. Please contact us in advance so we can coordinate accommodations that support your participation and comfort.
              </div>
            </details>

            <details class="group">
              <summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 py-6 text-lg font-semibold font-display text-[#155E5C] transition hover:bg-white/40 rounded-2xl px-2 [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden">
                <span>What is the inclement weather policy?</span>
                <span class="flex h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[#E0F6F2]/70 text-xl font-medium text-[#1E8F8A] shadow-sm transition group-open:rotate-45">+</span>
              </summary>
              <div class="px-2 pb-6 text-base leading-7 text-slate-700">
                Please check the Hampton University website for the latest information regarding weather-related closures or schedule changes.
              </div>
            </details>

            <details class="group">
              <summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 py-6 text-lg font-semibold font-display text-[#155E5C] transition hover:bg-white/40 rounded-2xl px-2 [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden">
                <span>How do I sign up for trips?</span>
                <span class="flex h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[#E0F6F2]/70 text-xl font-medium text-[#1E8F8A] shadow-sm transition group-open:rotate-45">+</span>
              </summary>
              <div class="px-2 pb-6 text-base leading-7 text-slate-700">
                Trip registration must be completed through the OLLI office. Please visit or contact our office to sign up for trips.
              </div>
            </details>

            <details class="group">
              <summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 py-6 text-lg font-semibold font-display text-[#155E5C] transition hover:bg-white/40 rounded-2xl px-2 [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden">
                <span>What is the refund and credit policy?</span>
                <span class="flex h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[#E0F6F2]/70 text-xl font-medium text-[#1E8F8A] shadow-sm transition group-open:rotate-45">+</span>
              </summary>
              <div class="px-2 pb-6 text-base leading-7 text-slate-700">
                No refunds or credits will be given for local, overnight trips, and movie days. Please review event-specific policies before registering.
              </div>
            </details>
          </div>
        </div>

        <aside class="space-y-6">
          <div class="rounded-2xl border border-white/40 bg-gradient-to-b from-[#2F8EAD]/40 to-[#35A6B0]/40 p-8 text-white shadow-[0_8px_32px_rgba(2,39,90,0.25)] backdrop-blur-md transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:border-white/60 hover:shadow-[0_14px_44px_rgba(2,39,90,0.35)]">
            <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-[#BFE9E6]">Quick Contact</p>
            <h2 class="mt-3 text-2xl font-semibold">Office hours</h2>
            <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-[#E5F6F6]">
              Monday – Friday, 8:00 AM–5:00 PM
            </p>
            <a href="https://form.jotform.com/240354605024143" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" class="mt-8 inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-white px-6 py-3 text-center text-base font-semibold text-[#0E6B72] shadow-lg transition hover:bg-[#F3F8FC]">
              Join OLLI-HU
            </a>
          </div>

        </aside>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-12 rounded-2xl border border-white/60 bg-gradient-to-b from-[#EEF9F7]/60 via-white/50 to-[#F3F7FE]/60 p-8 shadow-[0_20px_60px_-25px_rgba(2,39,90,0.25)] backdrop-blur-md sm:p-12">
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-4 md:flex-row md:items-end md:justify-between">
          <div>
            <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-[#1E8F8A]">Membership</p>
            <h2 id="membership" class="mt-2 text-3xl font-semibold text-[#02275A]">Annual Membership</h2>
          </div>
          <div class="rounded-full bg-[#E2F6F1] px-4 py-2 text-lg font-semibold text-[#155E5C]">
            $60 per year
          </div>
        </div>

        <p class="mt-6 text-lg leading-relaxed text-slate-700">
          Membership includes all OLLI at Hampton University programs, events, and access to the Institute’s member-led activities. The annual fee is the foundation of the organization’s programming and supports the community experience.
        </p>

        <div class="mt-8 grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-[1.1fr_0.9fr]">
          <div>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[#02275A]">Membership fee benefits</h2>
            <ul class="mt-4 space-y-3 text-lg text-slate-700">
              <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="mt-2 h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full bg-[#1E8F8A]"></span><span>Access to OLLI classes, lectures, and special events.</span></li>
              <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="mt-2 h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full bg-[#1E8F8A]"></span><span>Participation in member-led activities and social programs.</span></li>
              <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="mt-2 h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full bg-[#1E8F8A]"></span><span>Eligibility to join the broader Hampton University lifelong learning community.</span></li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="rounded-2xl border border-white/60 bg-white/40 p-6 backdrop-blur-md shadow-[0_8px_28px_rgba(2,39,90,0.12)]">
            <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[#155E5C]">Course fee</h2>
            <p class="mt-3 text-lg text-slate-700">
              Most courses are available for an additional <span class="font-semibold text-[#02275A]">$60</span> fee, depending on the offering and format.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-10 border-t border-[#D5ECE8] pt-8">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[#02275A]">Examples of membership scenarios</h2>
          <div class="mt-6 space-y-4 text-lg text-slate-700">
            <div class="rounded-2xl border border-white/60 bg-white/40 p-5 backdrop-blur-md shadow-[0_6px_20px_rgba(2,39,90,0.08)]">
              <p><span class="font-semibold text-[#155E5C]">Scenario 1:</span> Member joins for the year and attends a single course. Total: <span class="font-semibold text-[#155E5C]">$60 annual membership</span> plus the course fee if applicable.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="rounded-2xl border border-white/60 bg-white/40 p-5 backdrop-blur-md shadow-[0_6px_20px_rgba(2,39,90,0.08)]">
              <p><span class="font-semibold text-[#155E5C]">Scenario 2:</span> Member joins and participates in a full slate of classes and activities throughout the year. Total: <span class="font-semibold text-[#155E5C]">$60 annual membership</span> plus <span class="font-semibold text-[#155E5C]">$60 per course</span> where applicable.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="rounded-2xl border border-white/60 bg-white/40 p-5 backdrop-blur-md shadow-[0_6px_20px_rgba(2,39,90,0.08)]">
              <p><span class="font-semibold text-[#155E5C]">Scenario 3:</span> Member attends events without enrolling in courses. Total: <span class="font-semibold text-[#155E5C]">$60 annual membership</span> only, with no additional course fee.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
